Node ID=100 Ali
Text=Like a wharf rat, Ali knows how to scurry among the shadows and live off the discarded scraps of others. With his love for drink, he is drawn to the underbelly of any city like a fly to dung. If you seek that rogue, I suggest that you search the gutters and streets of the Port District...carefully. As my brother will tell you, Ali can be *difficult* to find.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=Very well, I have other questions.
Go to node ID=3 Return Dialogue
