Node ID=100 relics
Text=My Order has sent us to warn our western allies of disturbing events in the East. A relic sacred to my people has been stolen from our protection, and we fear that the treacherous villains responsible for this crime will also attempt to steal from the Knights Templar.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=Who are these villains?
