Node ID=100 villains
Text=We know only that they wield the blackest magic, powerful enough to shatter the wards our own sorcerers placed on the mosque protecting our relic. It is our hope that the Knights of Saladin and the Knights Templar will defeat these foes together, as our ancestors did so long ago.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
